Z||000004||Songman||04-24-2001||06:22 PM||||Several of us from the TN group will be arriving early Saturday morning. We plan to leave Nashville around 7am. Should put us there around 9am or so. No plans to stay at the moment but you never can tell.<P>We will be wearing TN Fiero badges and I am making Pennock's labels with our screen names to stick on for those of us that are on the forum.<P>Look forward to meeting all of you there, especially the ones that I talk to often...<P>Dale<P>Oh yeah, I'm driving my 88 T-top that I picked up yesterday. Not sure if it will be all one color by then or not. If not, it's burgundy with grey primer front and rear fascias!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 04-24-2001).]||||reg||1
