Z||000009||william_thorniii||04-24-2001||09:04 PM||||Songman,<P>I can bring a tent if you would like.  Last year, Ed offered his land as a camp ground.  No showers though.  You might want to e-mail him to verify that it is O.K.  Otherwise you could chip in for a room with myself and fiero56 we will be arriving early a.m. Saturday and have the room for Sat. night.  E-mail me if you want me to bring my tent (william_thorniii@hotmail.com) oh yeah, it is a monster... sleeps 8. <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||1
