Z||000026||Raydar||04-25-2001||05:41 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88 Database Nut:<BR><B>Hey Radar,<P>I'll be heading over Friday night most likely, but haven't made a hotel reserv. yet.  Can you remember where we stayed last year?  You know, the place where they had a drug bust right outside my room the first night?  I'd kind of like to avoid that place but can't remember what it was called!<P>See You All There,<P>John, 88 Database Nut</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>John,<P>I think that was the Motel 6. I stayed there last year. I think I heard it was a Red Carpet Inn, now.<P>Many folks are staying in the Comfort Inn. <BR>Don and Ashby are (I think) at the Holiday Inn Express.<BR>I'm at the LaQuinta East. It's on the same side of the street as, and within stumbling distance of, Ed and Rosy's favorite Mexican restaurant.<P><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
