Z||000040||Songman||04-28-2001||06:47 AM||||It's 5:45am and I'll soon be heading that way! Doug dropped off my Indy about an hour ago and I'm meeting up with Keith at 7:00 nd the rest of the people that are convoying with us at 8:00. It's a Fiero kinda day!<P>I sure did enjoy that 10 mile drive from the interstate to my house in the Indy! Hard decision as to which one to bring now! I had planned on the new T-top, but the Indy is so nice too.. But, T-top it is!<P>Can't wait to meet all of of you down there!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
